{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1785764319359,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":10,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":30,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you faced a significant technical challenge while working on a project. What steps did you take to understand the problem, and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":31,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with someone who had a different approach or opinion than your own. How did you navigate that difference to achieve a successful result?\"},{\"question_id\":32,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of a time when you made a mistake on a project – it doesn’t have to be a major failure. What did you learn from the experience, and how did you apply that learning moving forward?\"},{\"question_id\":33,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Can you walk me through a situation where you had to adapt quickly to changing requirements or priorities during a software development cycle? What adjustments did you make, and why?\"},{\"question_id\":34,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Describe a time you took initiative to improve a process or solve a problem within your team. What was the impact of your actions?\"}]}"]}
