{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1785764762025,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":20,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":80,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you faced a significant technical challenge while working on a project. What steps did you take to understand the problem, and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":81,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to collaborate with someone who had a different approach or opinion than your own. How did you navigate that difference to achieve a successful result?\"},{\"question_id\":82,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of when you identified an opportunity for improvement in a process or system – either technical or related to teamwork. What actions did you take, and what was the impact?\"},{\"question_id\":83,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Describe a time you made a mistake on a project. How did you handle it, what did you learn from the experience, and how would you approach a similar situation differently now?\"},{\"question_id\":84,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you had to adapt quickly to changing priorities or requirements during a project. What strategies did you use to manage your workload and ensure successful delivery?\"}]}"]}
